## Troubleshooting

### CSRF Token Missing

Make sure you have both middleware:

```typescript
app.use(csrfToken()); // Generate tokens
app.use(csrf());      // Validate tokens
```

### Rate Limit Not Working

Check Redis connection:

```typescript
import { initializeRedis } from './security';
initializeRedis(process.env.REDIS_URL);
```

### CORS Error

Add your domain to allowed origins:

```bash
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://yourdomain.com,https://app.yourdomain.com
```

### Password Validation Too Strict

Use `passwordSchema` instead of `strongPasswordSchema`:

```typescript
import { passwordSchema } from './security';
// Requires 8+ chars instead of 12+
```

